WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.132
GS4 case studies have no

2
00:00:02.132 --> 00:00:03.944
single right answer.

3
00:00:03.944 --> 00:00:05.344
But a good answer has

4
00:00:05.344 --> 00:00:06.799
a clear shape.

5
00:00:07.129 --> 00:00:08.470
List the stakeholders,

6
00:00:08.470 --> 00:00:10.279
and the values that clash.

7
00:00:10.279 --> 00:00:12.292
Weigh two or three options.

8
00:00:12.292 --> 00:00:13.496
Then choose one,

9
00:00:13.496 --> 00:00:15.072
and justify it.

10
00:00:15.389 --> 00:00:17.243
Your choice should be ethical,

11
00:00:17.243 --> 00:00:18.722
legal and practical.

12
00:00:18.722 --> 00:00:20.505
Heroic but illegal is not

13
00:00:20.505 --> 00:00:22.038
a good answer.

14
00:00:22.725 --> 00:00:24.808
Don't just inform your seniors

15
00:00:24.808 --> 00:00:25.789
and stop.

16
00:00:25.789 --> 00:00:27.089
And don't preach.

17
00:00:27.089 --> 00:00:28.727
Show what you would actually

18
00:00:28.727 --> 00:00:29.494
do.

19
00:00:29.809 --> 00:00:30.986
Your turn.

20
00:00:30.986 --> 00:00:32.769
What should the final option

21
00:00:32.769 --> 00:00:33.551
be?
